      "message": "A one-way conversion works; a two-way doesn\u0027t.\n\nThe main reason is that when converting from `files` to `reftable`, we do not show the option to keep a backup (a backup is always kept).\n\nAs a result, when converting back to `files` format, the `/reftable` remains in the repository and will prevent future conversions from the UI.\n\nI believe we should:\n1. Give the option to keep a backup or not in the dialog\n2. Block the conversion button if a previous backup exists\n\nThe 1. should be part of this change, so that you can enable the two-way use case. The 2. would require more work on the backend. It can be addressed as a follow-up.",
